<title>Venezuela and the Caribbean: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/venezuela/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-venezuela-2026-10-11T12:24:57.470Z</guid>
<pubDate>Sun, 11 Oct 2026 12:24:57 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;President Nicolás Maduro and First Lady Cilia Flores have been formally charged in the United States with ordering torture of dissidents and American citizens, prompting nationwide protests demanding their release. Explosions over Caracas and heightened military alerts have added a security flashpoint to the already severe socioeconomic collapse. Energy firms are recruiting former U.S. officials to gain access to Venezuelan oil, while diplomatic relations with Cuba have become more cautious. The crisis now combines legal battles, security tensions, and external economic maneuvers, a shift from earlier focus on hyperinflation and mass displacement. There were 2 battle-related deaths in 2007, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMisgFBVV95cUxQYXNJMXJneUtoY0ZlT2hsWjZ2dllxaXo1SXZCa1A4RzBvMkRZOEFDMDFXVnN1VnJlZDMtQ2NsVER1YjZfMEFlU3oyTE52NU1YR1B5WXlyVVp2LVdUbjltckJ0LVl2STF1cG9yc2p6Z1dyVlRkTTJzd2pfcllmRXdxS0pwbWZJbzZ4YjV4aVRfSlI1Z2RINV90bUgtT2ZPYXdQSHN0RkwyS3R1dEZNOEV3ZHZ3?oc=5&quot;&gt;France 24&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiugFBVV95cUxPeWhuNV9GV1ZnY2h4bzVRckxpYXAyTU5zSFo0OTlmQmRpYXRrYVVDUklOMEFpN0dkclJPTmlKd0pBVGgtTVUzR1NrZThwSy0xalZfSDUtWnZUNHg5enRfU1pPS1VBSHVaY2dFUldkT0ZEY1MtanBHSlNQSmgwbXJOcWNxaFozTlBpaG8xUkY2d3puM1IwSnlVWjNqcnFVazVjX18xczFJTHBxOW56Z0hNUU9ILV9SbUVPb1E?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Washington Post&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMirAFBVV95cUxNMy0wQV9wdjdjVFg3WnoyMVR6NWg1SmZjejZaNUtLR1FtSjJ6dVF4LS0xSTBPa29KSVJFM3Q4dGF5bWtKanNpY1V3RVAwM1lpSUhBN3NoeWY1ZGpVb3BKdzJpNzh2M3RRM0lXWTBHR2JBYWJ0dmpYODFIUnBjWXBaR01YdnBrbEtwbjUwWFltR1FhQzEzMm04dmR1U2N4N3E4TWVqVV9mNUtIS3pq?oc=5&quot;&gt;Reuters&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.g